      "title": "The mirror idea (geometry only)",
      "text": "This DEMO lesson uses plain mirror geometry: reflect the object ball across the rail and aim at the reflection. With both balls the same distance from the rail, the route touches the rail halfway between them. Real tables add spin, speed and cushion effects, which this demo ignores.",
